Chapter: DeskIconSizeTest
  cites Works chapter GopFat16
  cites Works chapter GopFont
  cites Works chapter GopDraw
  cites Works chapter GopDesk
  cites Works chapter GopIcon
  cites Works chapter GopComposite
  cites Foreword chapter Console

 A drawn icon is used only when one exists for the name AND the size it was
 rasterized at matches the size the gutter asks for. Two expressions have to
 agree: `dk-icons-init` settles the size at boot and `desk-icon-in` recomputes
 it on every paint. This prints both, and the drawn set's slots, so a
 disagreement is a number rather than a picture that did not change.

 WHAT A GATED RUN PROVES IS NOT THE SIZE. `seed/Codex.img` carries no typeface
 and the battery attaches no disk, so the recorded answer is the no-volume
 line. The table needs an image from `build-boot-img.ps1`.

Section: Body

  dis-w : Integer = 1600

Section: Entry

  opening : [Console, Device.Port] Nothing = act
    m <- gfat-mount-esp
    if m.gm-ok == False then print-line-uni "no FAT volume on the boot medium"
    else act
      let ppem = comp-glyph-h * ui-wscale dis-w
      in act
        f <- gfont-load (m.gm-vol) "CMUNSS.TTF" ppem
        if f.gf-ok == False then print-line-uni "CMUNSS.TTF: not loaded"
        else act
          let ws = ui-wscale dis-w
          in let avail = desk-text-w f ws desk-chrome-gutter
          in let scale = if avail < 8 then 1 else avail / 8
          in let ds = alloc-zeroed 128 64
          in let init = dk-icons-init ds f dis-w
          in let blk = peek-32 ds dk-icons-cell
          in act
            print-line-uni ("gutter avail  : " & integer-to-text avail)
            print-line-uni ("paint size    : " & integer-to-text (8 * scale))
            print-line-uni ("boot size     : " & integer-to-text (dk-icons-size blk))
            print-line-uni ("drawn menu    : " & (if gicon-drawn "menu" then "yes" else "no"))
            print-line-uni ("drawn nothing : " & (if gicon-drawn "cloud" then "yes" else "no"))
            print-line-uni ("menu blob     : " & (if dk-icons-at blk "menu" /= 0 then "set" else "ZERO"))
            print-line-uni ("power blob    : " & (if dk-icons-at blk "power" /= 0 then "set" else "ZERO"))
          end
        end
      end
    end
  end

